WEBVTT

01:24.600 --> 01:27.520
ADAPTED FROM THE LEGEND
OF KUNSHAN JADE BY TAN TIANYIN

01:43.480 --> 01:45.440
Duanwu, this place is great.

01:45.520 --> 01:47.600
There are big windows,
and we can see the sea.

01:48.720 --> 01:50.600
It's much better than the bilge.

02:04.680 --> 02:06.640
Even the blankets smell good.

02:06.720 --> 02:08.120
The smell of the sun.

02:27.560 --> 02:29.640
Duanwu, you're amazing.

02:38.400 --> 02:40.840
l can finally get a good night's sleep.

02:59.280 --> 03:02.160
Duanwu.
You work too hard, so take a break.

03:03.240 --> 03:05.120
I can only rest easy
if I work all the time.

03:07.040 --> 03:09.520
We've already entered the upper cabin,
joined the trading convoy,

03:09.600 --> 03:11.400
and lived in such a big house,

03:11.480 --> 03:12.840
so what's not to worry about?

03:12.920 --> 03:14.440
Shrimp, let me ask you.

03:14.520 --> 03:17.280
If you were to enlist the help
of a friend you've just met,

03:18.440 --> 03:20.840
what do you think
the success rate would be?

03:22.920 --> 03:24.120
Basically zero.

03:24.200 --> 03:28.000
You've always taught me
not to make unreasonable requests

03:28.080 --> 03:29.200
when befriending someone

03:29.280 --> 03:31.760
and not to expect friends
to give freely without regard

03:31.840 --> 03:32.720
to their own interests.

03:35.600 --> 03:36.600
That's true.

03:37.960 --> 03:39.760
Friends should be mutually beneficial.

03:40.320 --> 03:41.840
No one is obligated to help others.

03:46.200 --> 03:48.680
Duanwu, has Master
sent you on another mission?

03:51.040 --> 03:52.080
That's hard,

03:52.760 --> 03:54.040
but I have to do it.

03:55.480 --> 03:57.160
This is the finest Zui Ling Long

03:57.240 --> 03:59.720
I've ever gotten.

03:59.800 --> 04:02.080
I brought it as a gesture of goodwill.

04:06.520 --> 04:07.360
It's good wine.

04:12.440 --> 04:14.120
Assistant Pang.

04:14.880 --> 04:18.680
I don't know if I can drink
with you again after this.

04:19.399 --> 04:20.600
What are you talking about?

04:20.680 --> 04:23.080
I'm about to lose my job
because of that girl.

04:23.160 --> 04:26.200
That girl does have some skills.

04:27.160 --> 04:29.280
She beat you once with scraps,

04:29.360 --> 04:32.120
sold Coral Pearl like hotcakes,

04:32.200 --> 04:35.680
and can risk her life for Shark Hunting.

04:35.760 --> 04:37.240
She's tough.

04:38.880 --> 04:40.560
It's true that I'm not
as good as that girl

04:40.640 --> 04:42.520
when it comes to these shenanigans,

04:43.040 --> 04:45.760
but I'm loyal to you. Absolutely.

04:45.840 --> 04:48.160
If there's any benefit,
you'll be the first one I think of.

04:48.240 --> 04:50.160
Speak cautiously.

04:50.680 --> 04:51.800
What are you talking about?

04:51.880 --> 04:54.480
You should be loyal to Master.

04:55.680 --> 04:56.600
That's right.

04:57.240 --> 04:59.960
Assistant Pang is loyal to the Master,

05:00.040 --> 05:02.160
and I'm loyal to Assistant Pang.

05:02.240 --> 05:04.640
Different ways with the same goals.
No difference.

05:05.600 --> 05:06.720
Anyway,

05:06.800 --> 05:09.800
I will work for you in my life,

05:09.880 --> 05:12.560
so you can't watch me die.

05:12.640 --> 05:14.800
You've worked for me for so many years,

05:14.880 --> 05:16.240
so how could I treat you badly?

05:17.240 --> 05:20.200
Don't worry. There's a long way to go.

05:21.680 --> 05:24.120
I want to see how big a storm

05:24.200 --> 05:27.360
this girl can create.

05:32.600 --> 05:33.440
Look at this.

05:33.520 --> 05:34.720
Yeah, look.

05:34.800 --> 05:36.080
This is good. Look.

05:37.880 --> 05:38.760
Take the ledger.

05:44.000 --> 05:45.040
Duanwu.

05:47.000 --> 05:48.000
Sister Wu.

05:48.760 --> 05:50.080
Why didn't you come to me until now?

05:50.160 --> 05:51.440
I missed you.

05:51.960 --> 05:54.960
I came to you today
because I have something to tell you.

05:58.640 --> 06:00.800
Is this hairpin unsellable?

06:00.880 --> 06:02.320
If yes,

06:02.400 --> 06:04.200
let me take it back, so it won't

06:04.280 --> 06:05.600
take up space in the display case.

06:06.600 --> 06:08.240
Who said it's not selling?

06:08.320 --> 06:09.200
Look.

06:09.280 --> 06:12.360
I put your hairpin
in the most prominent place

06:12.440 --> 06:13.800
because it sells so well.

06:13.880 --> 06:16.280
It's the ace of my store.

06:16.360 --> 06:18.440
It's unique and low-priced,

06:18.520 --> 06:21.880
so all the girls in Guangzhou
are clamoring to buy it.

06:24.960 --> 06:27.800
You don't have to comfort me.

06:27.880 --> 06:29.720
I can make another one.

06:29.800 --> 06:31.360
Why should I comfort you?

06:31.440 --> 06:34.040
I've asked my men to take down the orders.

06:34.880 --> 06:36.600
Lan, the ledger.

06:36.680 --> 06:37.720
Wait a minute.

06:39.960 --> 06:40.840
Look.

06:41.400 --> 06:44.320
Let me turn to a random page. Look.

06:44.400 --> 06:45.760
This and this

06:45.840 --> 06:48.360
are the orders for the hairpin.

06:48.440 --> 06:50.800
You're now my cash cow.

06:54.520 --> 06:55.640
By the way…

06:55.720 --> 06:56.800
Looks like I'm just in time.

06:56.880 --> 06:59.320
Look. I've just made these recently.

07:01.800 --> 07:03.200
It's beautiful, Duanwu.

07:03.280 --> 07:04.720
I'll take them all.

07:06.640 --> 07:07.800
What were you going to tell me?

07:09.320 --> 07:10.560
There's something I want to ask you.

07:11.320 --> 07:13.640
How about this? I'll buy you a cup of tea.
We can take our time.

07:14.320 --> 07:15.200
Tea?

07:18.360 --> 07:19.320
No problem.

07:19.400 --> 07:21.600
I'm rich nowadays, so let me treat you.

07:21.680 --> 07:23.920
What's the difference
between my treat and yours?

07:24.000 --> 07:25.560
We don't need to argue about that.
Let's go.

07:25.640 --> 07:26.520
Don't worry. Let me treat you.

07:27.160 --> 07:28.840
Come on, Shrimp.
Let's go eat something good.

07:28.920 --> 07:29.800
Let's go.

07:30.440 --> 07:32.240
They make a great Cherry Dew Ball.

07:32.320 --> 07:33.200
You must try it.

07:33.280 --> 07:34.120
Cherry Dew Ball?

07:34.200 --> 07:36.280
That's enough. Get outta here.

07:36.360 --> 07:38.720
-Get outta here. Please.
-Sorry.

07:38.800 --> 07:40.840
If you guys don't leave,
we'll go out of business.

07:40.920 --> 07:41.760
-Please.
-Sorry.

07:41.840 --> 07:43.280
Please.

07:43.360 --> 07:44.280
Mr. Zhang.

07:44.840 --> 07:46.280
Sorry for the trouble.

07:46.360 --> 07:47.280
What happened?

07:47.360 --> 07:48.640
-Mr. Zhang.
-Mr. Zhang.

07:48.720 --> 07:50.360
-Duanwu.
-Because he pissed off Sea God.

07:50.440 --> 07:52.440
Look what they've done to our hotel.

07:53.120 --> 07:54.360
Pissed off Sea God?

07:54.440 --> 07:56.320
-Duanwu, don't worry.
-That's enough. Go away.

07:56.400 --> 07:58.360
Did Yan Zijing give you a hard time
after you went back last time?

07:59.680 --> 08:00.760
Mr. Zhang.

08:00.840 --> 08:02.360
Master didn't give me a hard time,

08:02.440 --> 08:05.240
and Shrimp and I
joined the trading convoy.

08:06.720 --> 08:07.760
Mr. Zhang, you…

08:07.840 --> 08:09.880
It's unfair for my master.

08:09.960 --> 08:12.680
After the Sea God Festival,
he just composed a poem,

08:12.760 --> 08:14.800
but some people say
my master angered Sea God.

08:14.880 --> 08:16.800
This morning, paint was thrown
on the aluminum tubes,

08:16.880 --> 08:17.960
so they won't allow us to stay here.

08:18.040 --> 08:19.200
There must be something strange
about this.

08:20.000 --> 08:22.160
Someone must be behind this.

08:22.240 --> 08:24.320
The owner is just being used.

08:25.840 --> 08:27.280
So, what now?

08:27.360 --> 08:30.240
Why don't you let me
find you a place to stay?

08:30.840 --> 08:33.159
Guangzhou is so big,
so how can I not have a place to stay?

08:35.520 --> 08:36.559
As the saying goes,

08:37.440 --> 08:38.919
"I can use the sky as my blanket

08:39.960 --> 08:41.200
and the earth as my bed."

08:41.960 --> 08:43.440
It's a good thing

08:43.520 --> 08:44.800
to have the sky and the earth
as my shelter, isn't it?

08:45.840 --> 08:47.400
Mr. Zhang, you are so funny.

08:48.000 --> 08:50.040
Duanwu and I are going for tea.
Do you want to join us?

08:50.120 --> 08:51.240
Right.

08:51.840 --> 08:54.640
Lady Wu said she'd take us

08:55.560 --> 08:56.800
to Cherry…

08:56.880 --> 08:58.920
-Dew Ball.
-Right.

08:59.000 --> 09:00.200
Do you want to join us?

09:00.280 --> 09:01.440
Yeah. Let's go together.

09:02.120 --> 09:03.280
-Come on, Mr. Zhang.
-Let's go.

09:03.920 --> 09:04.800
-Let's go.
-Go.

09:14.920 --> 09:17.560
I'm even stuffed today.

09:17.640 --> 09:18.880
Don't eat so fast.

09:18.960 --> 09:20.760
I said you should eat slowly.

09:20.840 --> 09:21.800
Have some tea.

09:25.600 --> 09:26.440
Feeling better?

09:29.800 --> 09:32.320
Mr. Zhang, what's Chang'an like?

09:33.920 --> 09:34.760
Duanwu.

09:35.560 --> 09:37.080
Do you remember what I told you?

09:39.360 --> 09:40.480
Baked flatbread of the West Market.

09:42.200 --> 09:43.560
There's something better than that.

09:44.200 --> 09:45.880
Inside the West Market in Chang'an,

09:45.960 --> 09:48.160
there are merchants and stalls everywhere.

09:48.240 --> 09:51.280
Stores run by girls abound.

09:54.320 --> 09:58.600
Can a woman do business
as a merchant in Chang'an?

09:58.680 --> 10:00.240
In some cases,

10:00.320 --> 10:01.960
women are even better.

10:02.640 --> 10:04.760
For example, the largest silk store

10:04.840 --> 10:06.120
in Chang'an's West Market.

10:06.720 --> 10:08.960
Its owner is a female embroiderer.

10:09.720 --> 10:12.320
It gets better than that.
In Chang'an's West Market,

10:12.400 --> 10:13.960
there is a famous winery.

10:14.640 --> 10:18.640
It's a popular destination
for the rich and famous.

10:18.720 --> 10:21.520
At first, we thought
it was owned by a man,

10:22.040 --> 10:24.000
but no one realized it was a determined

10:24.080 --> 10:25.320
and business-savvy woman.

10:25.400 --> 10:27.880
Mr. Zhang, you are very insightful.

10:28.600 --> 10:31.400
I must learn the ways of business
from my father

10:31.480 --> 10:34.240
to open Zhuobao House in Chang'an.

10:34.920 --> 10:37.120
You can do it.

10:37.200 --> 10:38.680
When you get to Chang'an,

10:38.760 --> 10:41.200
you will be one of the top merchants

10:41.280 --> 10:43.240
in the West Market in Chang'an.

10:43.320 --> 10:44.760
At that time…

10:46.640 --> 10:49.080
You'll have a good man.

10:50.280 --> 10:51.840
Don't be ridiculous.

10:51.920 --> 10:53.400
I found a place on the west side.

10:53.480 --> 10:55.240
It's getting late.
So, do you want to check it out?

10:55.760 --> 10:56.600
Sure.

10:57.760 --> 10:59.960
Girls. I'm gonna go check out my place.

11:00.040 --> 11:00.880
Excuse me.

11:04.000 --> 11:06.720
-Mr. Zhang, let me go with you.
-Okay.

11:06.800 --> 11:07.720
I'll see you off.

11:16.640 --> 11:17.480
Duanwu.

11:18.040 --> 11:20.680
For you, Mr. Zhang seems…

11:23.200 --> 11:24.520
Don't joke.

11:24.600 --> 11:26.840
Mr. Zhang is a gentleman

11:28.600 --> 11:30.000
and nice to everyone.

11:30.640 --> 11:34.600
He's been helping me since we first met.

11:34.680 --> 11:35.640
Mr. Zhang is a good man.

11:36.760 --> 11:41.320
But when he was worried about
your situation after Shark Hunting,

11:41.400 --> 11:43.640
he had a very concerned look,

11:43.720 --> 11:45.040
so I'm afraid he wasn't just helping you.

11:47.080 --> 11:50.440
In fact, I think
Mr. Zhang would be a good choice

11:50.520 --> 11:52.080
if that's what he's trying to do.

11:57.480 --> 11:59.040
You're joking again.

12:00.760 --> 12:02.240
That's Mr. Zhang.

12:03.560 --> 12:06.000
How can I be compared to Mr. Zhang?

12:08.320 --> 12:09.160
Sister Wu.

12:10.000 --> 12:12.000
I grew up on a pearl farm

12:12.720 --> 12:14.840
and lived in degradation all my life,

12:14.920 --> 12:17.240
so I wanted to escape one day

12:17.840 --> 12:19.680
to be free and travel around.

12:20.200 --> 12:21.280
Now that I'm out,

12:23.000 --> 12:23.920
I want

12:25.040 --> 12:26.000
to experience

12:27.320 --> 12:30.280
the world for myself.

12:32.160 --> 12:33.480
Duanwu.

12:33.560 --> 12:35.720
You're so smart and strong,

12:35.800 --> 12:38.320
so you will have whatever you want.

12:39.840 --> 12:41.320
Before, I was trapped in my fate

12:42.000 --> 12:43.680
and was sad every day,

12:44.320 --> 12:45.560
until I met you,

12:45.640 --> 12:46.840
In fact,

12:46.920 --> 12:48.960
the lies of the fortune tellers
you uncovered for me

12:49.040 --> 12:50.080
were not crucial.

12:50.920 --> 12:54.120
What really changed me
was the power you gave me.

12:56.720 --> 12:59.560
Not me, but yourself.

13:00.520 --> 13:01.480
You have the power.

13:10.400 --> 13:11.400
Sister Wu.

13:13.000 --> 13:13.920
There's something I want to ask you.

13:14.000 --> 13:15.320
Please.

13:15.400 --> 13:16.840
Can Zhuobao House

13:16.920 --> 13:19.320
purchase pearls for Yan's Trading Convoy?

13:21.440 --> 13:24.400
I know this is a difficult matter for you.

13:24.480 --> 13:26.600
There's a lot at stake here.

13:26.680 --> 13:28.520
If you take this deal,

13:28.600 --> 13:29.960
you will be involved

13:30.040 --> 13:32.800
in a fight between Cui's Pearl Farm
and Yan's Trading Convoy,

13:32.880 --> 13:34.920
and Cui's Pearl Farm may turn against you,

13:35.520 --> 13:37.880
so I understand your concern.

13:38.680 --> 13:39.600
You don't have to force yourself.

13:46.480 --> 13:47.320
Duanwu.

13:48.040 --> 13:49.120
Tell me.

13:49.920 --> 13:51.720
Are you already involved?

13:53.600 --> 13:54.440
Yes.

13:58.000 --> 14:00.280
But don't worry. I have another way.

14:01.080 --> 14:02.200
This will not affect me.

14:03.920 --> 14:04.760
I will help you.

14:08.960 --> 14:11.320
Zhuobao House has always been non-aligned,

14:11.400 --> 14:13.520
but I don't care
what Yan's Trading Convoy is.

14:14.760 --> 14:16.280
As long as it's from you,

14:17.680 --> 14:19.960
I'll take the deal

14:21.320 --> 14:22.920
and convince my father.

14:24.000 --> 14:25.240
Don't worry.

14:28.320 --> 14:29.480
You've been so good to me.

14:31.880 --> 14:33.240
How should I thank you?

14:34.400 --> 14:35.760
We don't need to discuss this.

14:37.360 --> 14:40.280
Sister Wu.
Your friendship with me is one thing,

14:40.920 --> 14:43.560
but Zhuobao House
and Yan's Trading Convoy are another.

14:44.160 --> 14:45.680
I've requested from Master

14:45.760 --> 14:47.040
that 10% of the turnover

14:47.120 --> 14:49.480
will be used to compensate Zhuobao House.

14:49.560 --> 14:50.680
I won't let you lose out.

14:50.760 --> 14:51.920
OK.

14:52.000 --> 14:55.960
Let's make a lot of money together.

14:57.720 --> 14:59.680
Jia's voice in the night
heralds prosperity.

14:59.760 --> 15:02.760
We can look at the handsome boy
on the other side of the river.

15:03.360 --> 15:04.800
Later, let's go to Chang'an together.

15:11.680 --> 15:12.680
That's right.

15:12.760 --> 15:13.920
Yes.

15:17.960 --> 15:19.760
FUXU PORT

15:19.840 --> 15:20.760
Excuse me, please.

15:20.840 --> 15:21.720
Duanwu.

15:24.840 --> 15:26.520
Mr. Zhang. You're…

15:26.600 --> 15:28.000
Is the place on the west side bad?

15:28.080 --> 15:29.880
Can you take me to your master?

15:32.080 --> 15:33.240
I want to stay at The Mirage.

15:33.320 --> 15:34.600
The Mirage?

15:34.680 --> 15:35.520
Didn't you say

15:36.640 --> 15:38.000
you were looking for a place for me?

15:40.840 --> 15:42.360
I can take you to Master,

15:42.440 --> 15:44.880
but I can't decide
if you can stay at The Mirage.

15:45.840 --> 15:47.520
-Thank you very much.
-Please.

15:49.520 --> 15:50.400
Hey.

15:51.360 --> 15:52.480
You're back.

15:54.080 --> 15:56.200
I heard you were very skillful.

15:56.280 --> 15:58.360
You can sell a lot of pearls

15:58.440 --> 16:01.080
and make men fall in love with you
like a mistress.

16:01.680 --> 16:04.720
Seeing you today is a real eye-opener.

16:05.640 --> 16:07.720
Mr. Zhang, I'm sorry. Please.

16:09.120 --> 16:12.360
Everything you've done will be known.

16:12.440 --> 16:13.640
I've been asking around.

16:13.720 --> 16:15.520
At Cui's Pearl Farm,

16:15.600 --> 16:17.400
that friend of yours
always got laid with men.

16:17.480 --> 16:19.360
-What did you say?
-Mr. Zhang.

16:20.720 --> 16:21.760
It's crowded here.

16:25.080 --> 16:26.160
You guys…

16:27.720 --> 16:28.760
Please.

16:30.160 --> 16:31.000
Come on.

16:32.400 --> 16:33.240
Go to work.

16:33.320 --> 16:34.160
-Go to work.
-Mr. Zhang.

16:34.920 --> 16:35.920
Go…

16:36.000 --> 16:37.280
Go away.

16:41.960 --> 16:43.920
Damn, Duanwu.

16:44.600 --> 16:46.920
She colluded with Zhuobao House

16:47.000 --> 16:49.240
and is now seducing Mr. Zhang
to make him work for her.

16:50.400 --> 16:51.480
Assistant Pang.

16:51.560 --> 16:53.320
If you don't do something,

16:53.400 --> 16:55.040
she'll step on your head soon.

16:55.120 --> 16:57.000
Idiot. Get to work.

17:03.560 --> 17:04.480
Mr. Zhang.

17:12.640 --> 17:13.599
Master.

17:16.599 --> 17:17.680
Hello, Master Yan.

17:23.760 --> 17:25.160
You've finally come back.

17:27.319 --> 17:28.400
I thought you'd never come back.

17:30.600 --> 17:32.600
How's it going? Have you eaten?

17:38.560 --> 17:40.480
Mr. Zhang. Come on. Sit down.

17:52.960 --> 17:56.480
Mr. Zhang, what brings you

17:57.680 --> 17:58.520
to The Mirage so often?

18:02.400 --> 18:03.720
Your place

18:04.880 --> 18:05.800
is very elegant.

18:07.280 --> 18:09.640
I can listen to the waves

18:09.720 --> 18:11.240
and watch the current from here,

18:12.040 --> 18:14.840
so, I'd like to stay at The Mirage.

18:14.920 --> 18:17.400
Just say you want to stay here.
You don't have to make it so pleasant.

18:19.600 --> 18:21.400
But how can a man

18:22.080 --> 18:23.280
of Mr. Zhang's talent live here?

18:25.720 --> 18:26.720
Master.

18:27.320 --> 18:28.760
There are rooms available in The Mirage.

18:28.840 --> 18:30.560
Is it your turn to talk?

18:33.560 --> 18:34.680
Don't forget who you are.

18:39.320 --> 18:40.240
It's ungenerous

18:41.440 --> 18:43.080
for a man

18:44.280 --> 18:45.760
to take it out on a girl.

18:46.720 --> 18:48.600
Everything she has is from me.

18:48.680 --> 18:50.760
What's the point

18:51.720 --> 18:52.560
of Mr. Zhang's sweet talk?

18:54.160 --> 18:55.720
You're staying in my place,

18:56.840 --> 18:58.360
so where's your dignity as a man?

19:05.480 --> 19:06.560
It won't matter if I don't have that,

19:07.360 --> 19:09.560
but it'll be best if I do.

19:09.640 --> 19:10.680
Plus,

19:12.480 --> 19:13.640
you'll be able

19:14.560 --> 19:18.040
to return the favor
of my entering Cui's Pearl Farm for you.

19:19.560 --> 19:21.240
Since you're using me as a tool,

19:21.320 --> 19:23.240
you should use it well.

19:25.240 --> 19:27.640
A cunning rabbit dies.
A good bow will be hidden.

19:27.720 --> 19:29.440
The cunning rabbit

19:30.520 --> 19:31.400
is not yet dead,

19:32.280 --> 19:35.160
so you need not be in such a hurry
to part with the good bow.

19:46.760 --> 19:47.960
Good tea.

19:51.200 --> 19:54.000
I don't understand what you're saying,

19:55.240 --> 19:56.120
but…

19:57.880 --> 19:58.840
I'll allow you to stay.

20:01.360 --> 20:03.360
Kang Ju, arrange a good room

20:04.840 --> 20:05.960
for Mr. Zhang.

20:11.600 --> 20:13.120
Thank you, Master Yan.

20:29.800 --> 20:30.920
Master.

20:32.040 --> 20:33.200
Lady Wu agreed.

20:33.720 --> 20:35.800
If there's nothing else, I'll leave now.

20:58.880 --> 21:01.880
This is a small token
of Master Shijiu's appreciation.

21:07.760 --> 21:10.400
You're worthy of the one
who's traveled the world

21:10.480 --> 21:11.520
with Yan's Trading Convoy
and seen great things.

21:11.600 --> 21:15.720
You really don't care
about ordinary jewelry.

21:15.800 --> 21:19.360
This is one of Cui's Pearl Farm's
18 jewelry houses.

21:19.880 --> 21:22.600
Master Shijiu would like
to give it to you to manage.

21:23.360 --> 21:25.480
Your ambition and skills

21:26.000 --> 21:28.040
can be utilized here.

21:28.680 --> 21:31.160
This is Master Shijiu's sincerity.

21:31.760 --> 21:34.440
What do you think?

21:46.480 --> 21:47.360
Come in.

21:54.280 --> 21:55.120
Mr. Zhang.

21:55.840 --> 21:57.640
You're cheekier than I thought.

21:57.720 --> 21:59.000
In that respect,

21:59.680 --> 22:00.760
I am no match for you.

22:10.840 --> 22:12.600
A Xiuwen Pavilion scholar

22:12.680 --> 22:14.000
has taken up residence at The Mirage

22:14.600 --> 22:15.880
because he just wants an answer.

22:18.000 --> 22:19.080
Go ahead.

22:19.160 --> 22:21.280
You attracted the attention of Guangzhou's
jewelry houses with the Poetry Gathering,

22:21.360 --> 22:23.240
enlisted the guild lead
to enter the Guangzhou market

22:23.320 --> 22:24.160
with the colored stone,

22:24.240 --> 22:26.560
and then used the help of the guild lead

22:26.640 --> 22:28.160
in Guangzhou to acquire pearls for you.

22:30.240 --> 22:31.880
You failed in Shark Hunting,

22:32.920 --> 22:34.960
but you secretly went
to Lady Wu's Zhuobao House

22:35.040 --> 22:36.080
and asked them to buy pearls for you.

22:36.160 --> 22:38.760
At this point, the Cui family,
waiting to be saved by the pearls,

22:38.840 --> 22:40.240
is at the end of their rope.

22:40.920 --> 22:42.000
Under your plan,

22:42.080 --> 22:44.440
they will not be able
to acquire any pearls

22:44.520 --> 22:46.080
or have a chance
to get back on their feet.

22:46.840 --> 22:50.560
You did all this
so that the Cui family would die.

22:59.680 --> 23:00.640
So what?

23:00.720 --> 23:02.920
What does the Cui family,
having prospered for a hundred years,

23:05.400 --> 23:07.240
have against you

23:07.320 --> 23:09.640
that you would kill them all like this?

23:22.200 --> 23:23.560
What's so strange about that?

23:25.720 --> 23:27.800
The business world is like a battlefield.

23:27.880 --> 23:29.160
Everyone fights to the death,

23:29.760 --> 23:30.760
so the fewer rivals the better.

23:31.840 --> 23:33.080
But Mr. Zhang,

23:34.240 --> 23:36.720
you're just a civil official

23:36.800 --> 23:37.960
and not a businessman,

23:39.680 --> 23:41.160
so what were you doing
at Cui's Pearl Farm?

23:48.120 --> 23:49.280
I'm just

23:49.880 --> 23:51.480
a profit-seeking businessman,

23:51.560 --> 23:55.320
but I can see you're ambitious,

23:56.000 --> 23:57.040
so,

23:59.080 --> 24:00.320
do you want to gain power?

24:07.040 --> 24:08.320
Peace is only possible

24:09.400 --> 24:10.800
when everyone is settled.

24:15.000 --> 24:16.440
So, did you get the answer
you were looking for?

24:17.040 --> 24:18.480
That depends on what clues

24:19.240 --> 24:20.520
you'll give me.

24:28.040 --> 24:29.160
Clues

24:29.920 --> 24:30.760
are like kites.

24:31.880 --> 24:33.600
Sometimes, you think the thread is broken,

24:34.880 --> 24:35.760
but in fact,

24:40.880 --> 24:42.160
it may be right next to you.

25:03.680 --> 25:06.000
Master Shijiu, it is indeed as you said.

25:06.080 --> 25:07.880
Zhuobao House
is secretly buying pearls in bulk.

25:08.640 --> 25:11.800
How much money can an obscure
jewelry house have for stockpiling?

25:13.000 --> 25:13.880
Keep an eye on them.

25:13.960 --> 25:15.440
But they're offering

25:15.520 --> 25:17.160
more than double the market price

25:17.240 --> 25:19.480
and threatening to buy
as many as they can.

25:24.280 --> 25:26.480
How can a jewelry store
have so much money?

25:28.280 --> 25:30.080
There must be someone behind the scenes.

25:34.560 --> 25:36.600
-Yan Zijing?
-Yes.

25:37.360 --> 25:38.200
By the way,

25:38.840 --> 25:41.640
we've kicked Zhang Jinran
out of the inn as you ordered.

25:41.720 --> 25:43.280
We wanted to take the opportunity
to do that,

25:43.360 --> 25:46.680
but Zhang Jinran
is staying at Yan Zijing's The Mirage.

25:46.760 --> 25:48.280
Cui Jia can't find an opportunity now.

25:50.360 --> 25:51.480
It's better that he has no chance.

25:52.080 --> 25:53.760
With Zhang Jinran's status,
we can't do anything to him.

25:55.040 --> 25:56.200
The sly jerk Xu Nanying wants

25:56.280 --> 25:59.120
to use us to remove a thorn in his side,

26:00.800 --> 26:02.880
but he's pushing us into trouble.

26:03.960 --> 26:05.160
Tell Cui Jia

26:05.800 --> 26:06.880
there's no need to rush things.

26:07.520 --> 26:08.400
Yes.

26:13.800 --> 26:15.000
Sir.

26:15.760 --> 26:17.320
We've recently checked

26:17.400 --> 26:18.440
Special Envoy Xu's tracks and connections.

26:18.520 --> 26:21.120
He's only been receiving
small favors from Cui's Pearl Farm.

26:21.800 --> 26:23.080
Can that pay for itself?

26:26.320 --> 26:28.120
Will a small favor

26:30.320 --> 26:32.520
make Cui Shijiu keep coming after us?

26:38.000 --> 26:41.160
Then we'll invite him
and set a trap for him.

26:42.360 --> 26:44.160
I want to know how much my senior

26:44.240 --> 26:45.880
is willing to contribute.

26:49.200 --> 26:51.800
Is this clerk
so frightened by Cui Shijiu that he

26:52.640 --> 26:53.800
doesn't want to leave the ship?

26:54.320 --> 26:56.960
He is waiting for me,

26:57.520 --> 27:00.080
Cui's Pearl Farm, and Xu Nanying.

27:00.160 --> 27:02.080
He knows it's time to finish it.

27:02.880 --> 27:04.320
He wouldn't hesitate

27:04.840 --> 27:06.360
at the first opportunity.

27:08.840 --> 27:11.360
-Urgent.
-Urgent, sir.

27:12.160 --> 27:14.680
Why are you in such a panic? Tell me.

27:14.760 --> 27:16.240
There's official word

27:16.320 --> 27:17.920
that Zhang Jinran
has called for a fast horse

27:18.000 --> 27:20.120
to get back to Beijing immediately.

27:20.200 --> 27:23.320
I heard they'd got
Cui's Pearl Farm's ledgers

27:24.000 --> 27:25.280
and a witness.

27:28.840 --> 27:30.680
Zhang Jinran isn't dead?

27:31.640 --> 27:34.360
Cui Shijiu drove him out of the inn

27:34.440 --> 27:36.120
by some means,

27:36.200 --> 27:38.080
but not long after, he checked

27:38.160 --> 27:40.120
into The Mirage in Yan Zijing.

27:40.840 --> 27:43.440
After that, they didn't stand a chance.

27:45.960 --> 27:47.360
I'll leave this

27:48.120 --> 27:48.960
to you.

27:50.040 --> 27:50.880
Understood.

27:58.040 --> 28:00.080
Throw him out of the inn?

28:00.160 --> 28:02.680
Cui Shijiu, were you so perfunctory?

29:16.600 --> 29:18.160
Sir, are you alright?

29:18.240 --> 29:19.120
Yes, go after him.

29:30.240 --> 29:31.480
Master.

29:31.560 --> 29:32.920
The pearls have all been counted.

29:33.720 --> 29:35.040
Tomorrow,

29:35.120 --> 29:37.840
a merchant from the South Sea
will arrive in Guangzhou.

29:39.120 --> 29:42.000
I will also acquire the pearls he brought.

29:42.080 --> 29:43.320
Even this batch of pearls?

29:44.160 --> 29:45.480
What's the problem?

29:45.560 --> 29:47.000
Master is not in business, I'm afraid.

29:48.840 --> 29:50.320
You're in no position
to speculate on my mind.

29:52.280 --> 29:53.200
Come with me.

30:11.000 --> 30:12.160
Come in.

30:14.320 --> 30:18.840
YAN

30:40.600 --> 30:41.520
The people of the Central Plains

30:42.160 --> 30:45.280
only know white jewels
but not colored stones,

30:46.040 --> 30:47.720
such as these.

30:47.800 --> 30:49.080
Red Huo Qi.

30:49.160 --> 30:50.120
Blue Se.

30:50.200 --> 30:51.880
Yellow Naosou Pearl.

30:51.960 --> 30:54.000
As well as crystal, aurin,

30:54.080 --> 30:56.200
amber, and glaze.

30:56.280 --> 30:58.120
All from the Western Regions.

31:06.560 --> 31:08.080
Why are you showing me this?

31:09.240 --> 31:10.560
To open your eyes.

31:21.680 --> 31:23.000
Don't move.

31:41.040 --> 31:43.280
When you meet the client tomorrow,

31:43.360 --> 31:44.720
dress up well,

31:45.400 --> 31:46.480
so you won't lose your grace.

31:47.720 --> 31:49.240
Make an offer with Wei Yan,

31:49.800 --> 31:52.280
but remember I want

31:54.840 --> 31:55.800
all the pearls.

32:13.240 --> 32:14.320
Master.

32:14.400 --> 32:16.080
Mr. Zhang is back.

32:16.160 --> 32:17.600
He seems to be injured.

32:24.920 --> 32:26.720
Mr. Zhang, this is Duanwu.

32:26.800 --> 32:27.760
May I come in?

32:28.680 --> 32:29.520
Come in.

32:37.680 --> 32:39.600
What happened? Why are you hurt?

32:40.280 --> 32:41.800
Don't worry. It's just a scratch.

32:42.880 --> 32:45.240
-Are you hurt anywhere else?
-No.

32:46.960 --> 32:48.600
-Let me help you.
-I can…

33:01.320 --> 33:02.440
Hold on.

33:08.760 --> 33:09.720
There you go.

33:17.120 --> 33:18.120
Why haven't I seen Mr. Du?

33:21.360 --> 33:22.440
He had some work to attend to.

33:29.720 --> 33:30.880
You didn't go to Hepu

33:30.960 --> 33:32.760
just for fun, did you?

33:38.320 --> 33:39.160
That's right.

33:40.000 --> 33:41.120
For Cui's Pearl Farm

33:41.880 --> 33:42.720
or Yan's?

33:42.800 --> 33:44.160
Maybe there's no difference.

33:47.880 --> 33:49.680
Don't you think Yan Zijingd's purpose
is not business?

33:52.000 --> 33:53.720
What do you mean?

33:53.800 --> 33:55.440
I told you before

33:56.960 --> 33:58.040
you should stay away from him.

33:58.800 --> 34:00.120
I don't know

34:01.320 --> 34:04.240
what your intentions are
or what you want to do.

34:04.320 --> 34:05.640
And I don't want to know.

34:06.640 --> 34:08.440
When I get what I want,

34:09.199 --> 34:10.120
I'll leave.

34:10.199 --> 34:11.520
But when is that?

34:22.280 --> 34:23.760
You said before

34:26.840 --> 34:29.199
that you just wanted to be a free peddler.

34:30.280 --> 34:31.280
I haven't forgotten.

34:34.239 --> 34:35.239
That's what I've always wanted.

34:38.840 --> 34:40.280
At first, I only came to the ship

34:41.120 --> 34:43.280
to get back my mother's relics,

34:43.360 --> 34:45.120
but now,

34:45.800 --> 34:47.159
I think I can

34:49.239 --> 34:50.239
see hope on this ship.

34:51.000 --> 34:53.000
This is what Yan Zijing calls
the law of the jungle.

34:53.080 --> 34:53.960
Mr. Zhang.

34:54.040 --> 34:56.800
People like us are weaklings
who could be eaten

34:58.040 --> 34:59.240
by the strong anywhere.

34:59.760 --> 35:00.960
There's nothing wrong with that.

35:09.920 --> 35:11.800
I don't want you
to become like Yan Zijing.

35:37.360 --> 35:38.960
Remember to change your medicine tomorrow.

35:56.880 --> 35:57.840
Master Shijiu.

35:57.920 --> 35:59.360
Every cloud has a silver lining.

35:59.440 --> 36:01.120
A merchant from the South Sea
has recently arrived in Guangzhou.

36:01.200 --> 36:02.640
He is selling pearls in large quantities.

36:04.600 --> 36:05.760
Is this man trustworthy?

36:06.360 --> 36:08.240
I can't confirm it, but…

36:11.320 --> 36:13.880
Master Shijiu.
Xu Nanying tried to kill Zhang Jinran,

36:15.040 --> 36:16.480
but Zhang Jinran escaped.

36:20.280 --> 36:21.720
Zhang Jinran.

36:21.800 --> 36:23.080
Where is Zhang Jinran?

36:24.560 --> 36:25.400
Zhang…

36:26.280 --> 36:27.160
He has returned to The Mirage.

36:27.880 --> 36:29.080
Where is the ledger?

36:29.160 --> 36:30.600
Have you seen the ledger?

36:30.680 --> 36:32.320
Is that still with him?

36:33.640 --> 36:34.920
At that time,

36:35.000 --> 36:37.840
the killers only saw
Zhang Jinran and Du Ming

36:38.440 --> 36:40.680
but no one from Cui's Pearl Farm.

36:40.760 --> 36:43.040
Did he not see or did he not find

36:43.120 --> 36:45.240
the ones you sent?

36:45.760 --> 36:47.200
Why would we send someone

36:47.280 --> 36:50.360
to kill him if there were not those two?

36:52.760 --> 36:53.640
I…

36:57.920 --> 36:58.840
No.

37:00.040 --> 37:00.880
Not right.

37:03.560 --> 37:05.760
Zhang Jinran was setting a trap.

37:07.160 --> 37:09.360
The killers came back

37:09.440 --> 37:11.760
and saw Zhang Jinran back at The Mirage.

37:11.840 --> 37:14.520
Was he alone or with someone else?

37:16.520 --> 37:17.960
Zhang Jinran returned

37:18.640 --> 37:20.120
to The Mirage alone.

37:25.120 --> 37:27.640
The killer was followed.

37:27.720 --> 37:30.400
We were exposed.

37:32.040 --> 37:33.520
It was my fault.

37:35.920 --> 37:37.120
Where is the killer now?

37:38.680 --> 37:39.560
Right outside the door.

37:41.600 --> 37:42.680
Get up.

37:49.440 --> 37:50.440
Now.

37:51.400 --> 37:52.440
Kill him…

37:53.840 --> 37:55.520
quietly.

37:55.600 --> 37:56.520
Go.

37:57.800 --> 37:58.840
Yes.

38:04.040 --> 38:05.960
I followed the killer
to Xu Nanying's place.

38:06.480 --> 38:07.600
The killer

38:08.440 --> 38:09.280
went to see Xu Lin.

38:10.040 --> 38:11.320
It's really him.

38:15.400 --> 38:16.800
Since he's so nervous

38:16.880 --> 38:18.720
that he tried to kill you,

38:18.800 --> 38:19.760
I'm afraid we're deeply involved in it.

38:21.800 --> 38:24.560
Xu Nanying and I were fellows,

38:25.160 --> 38:27.840
but now, he's become like this.

38:28.600 --> 38:30.240
My master would be heartbroken

38:31.040 --> 38:32.160
if he knew.

38:34.840 --> 38:36.360
So, what do we do next?

38:37.640 --> 38:41.120
Send the ledger secretly to Beijing
and hand it over to Prince Ying.

38:42.200 --> 38:44.720
When the matter of Cui's Pearl Farm's
tribute pearls is irreparable,

38:45.560 --> 38:47.400
take the opportunity
to report it to the Emperor

38:49.600 --> 38:50.520
and ask for a thorough investigation.

38:51.840 --> 38:52.680
Yes.

38:55.800 --> 38:59.760
SISTER, YAN ZILIN

39:13.000 --> 39:14.720
The secret agent wrote back.

39:15.280 --> 39:17.960
Back then, Cui Ding did pass

39:18.040 --> 39:19.760
through Shaozhou
after leaving Yan's house.

39:23.560 --> 39:25.920
-Any news from Shaozhou?
-Not yet.

39:29.400 --> 39:30.960
We have to step up our game in Guangzhou.

39:32.320 --> 39:33.680
We can't stay here for long.

39:37.480 --> 39:41.520
SISTER, YAN ZILIN

39:46.920 --> 39:48.040
Be careful.

39:48.120 --> 39:49.480
Hold it lightly.

39:49.560 --> 39:51.120
-Be careful.
-Mr. Cao.

39:51.680 --> 39:52.920
Take another count.

39:53.000 --> 39:54.120
Okay.

39:54.200 --> 39:55.080
Zai.

39:55.160 --> 39:58.280
Today, Master gave Duanwu
a new set of clothes

39:58.360 --> 39:59.400
and a lot of jewelry.

39:59.480 --> 40:01.240
-They're all very nice.
-Why?

40:01.320 --> 40:03.280
Don't you know this?

40:03.360 --> 40:05.720
Duanwu is going to do something big
with Accountant Wei.

40:05.800 --> 40:07.840
Do something big with Accountant Wei?

40:07.920 --> 40:08.880
Duanwu is really something.

40:08.960 --> 40:09.960
Of course.

40:10.960 --> 40:13.720
When we're done, let's get a drink.

40:14.400 --> 40:16.360
No. I said I'd see Duanwu off.

40:18.160 --> 40:19.600
Accountant Wei hasn't come down yet,

40:19.680 --> 40:20.880
so we can come back
after we get some water.

40:21.560 --> 40:22.560
Okay.

40:22.640 --> 40:23.560
Let's go.

40:26.560 --> 40:27.600
Let's go.

40:27.680 --> 40:28.720
-Sisters.
-Drink water.

40:28.800 --> 40:30.800
We'll go down and get some water.

40:30.880 --> 40:31.720
Okay.

40:32.360 --> 40:33.480
Take it easy.

40:34.160 --> 40:36.040
-Hurry up.
-Okay.

40:38.160 --> 40:39.040
Mr. Cao.

40:40.360 --> 40:41.280
Follow me.

41:04.560 --> 41:06.280
Be careful. Don't let Master find out.

41:09.040 --> 41:10.080
Then,

41:13.960 --> 41:15.800
you can speak louder from now on.

41:26.080 --> 41:27.080
What are you doing?

41:27.160 --> 41:29.760
Ten catties of scrap you handled
are missing.

41:29.840 --> 41:33.440
How dare you embezzle public property?

41:33.520 --> 41:34.440
I didn't.

41:34.520 --> 41:36.160
Don't argue. Arrest him.

41:36.240 --> 41:37.120
I didn't.

41:37.200 --> 41:38.600
-Come on.
-You're wronging me.

41:38.680 --> 41:40.160
You're slandering me.

41:40.760 --> 41:41.920
Let me go.

41:42.000 --> 41:43.000
Let me go.

41:43.080 --> 41:44.600
You're slandering me.

41:52.520 --> 41:53.360
Duanwu.

41:53.440 --> 41:54.400
Xiu.

41:55.120 --> 41:56.440
Hu.

41:56.520 --> 41:57.840
You look so pretty today.

41:58.360 --> 42:00.920
This hairpin is so chic.

42:01.000 --> 42:03.520
By the way, have you seen Shrimp?
I can't find him.

42:03.600 --> 42:05.200
I think Shrimp

42:05.840 --> 42:08.040
went to the bilge with Loud for water.

42:08.120 --> 42:09.080
Right.

42:09.160 --> 42:10.200
Duanwu.

42:10.840 --> 42:11.680
Let's go.

42:13.320 --> 42:15.280
Tell him I'm going out and will be back

42:15.360 --> 42:16.520
-as soon as I can.
-Okay.

42:16.600 --> 42:17.800
-I'll bring you some goodies.
-Nice.

42:18.920 --> 42:21.040
These scraps were 100 catties,

42:21.120 --> 42:22.640
and I weighed them in front of you,

42:22.720 --> 42:25.120
so how can they be 110 catties
in the ledge?

42:25.200 --> 42:27.080
Still quibbling? I'll…

42:27.840 --> 42:29.240
You do it.

42:32.320 --> 42:34.600
Mr. Cao, this is…

42:34.680 --> 42:35.760
Not a misunderstanding.

42:35.840 --> 42:38.320
Assistant Pang is here,
so who would frame him?

42:38.400 --> 42:40.040
On this ship, whoever makes a mistake

42:40.120 --> 42:42.440
has to receive punishment.

42:42.520 --> 42:44.040
I didn't make a mistake.

42:44.120 --> 42:45.040
Hit him.

42:46.600 --> 42:48.800
Shrimp. I'm going to Duanwu.

42:49.480 --> 42:50.640
Don't go to her.

42:51.920 --> 42:53.160
Duanwu

42:54.120 --> 42:55.440
has a big day today.
